{"task_id": "Mbpp/227", "solution": "def validate_inputs(a, b, c) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Check that each of a, b, c is an instance of int or float.\"\"\"\n    return isinstance(a, (int, float)) and \\\n           isinstance(b, (int, float)) and \\\n           isinstance(c, (int, float))\n\ndef min_of_three(a, b, c):\n    \"\"\"Validate three inputs and return the numeric minimum among them; raise TypeError on non-numeric inputs.\"\"\"\n    if not validate_inputs(a, b, c):\n        raise TypeError(\"All inputs must be numeric\")\n    return min(a, b, c)"}
