{"task_id": "Mbpp/422", "solution": "def find_Average_Of_Cube(n):\n    \"\"\"Compute and return the average of cubes of the first n natural numbers as a float.\n\n    Args:\n        n (int): number of first natural numbers to include (precondition: n >= 1).\n\n    Returns:\n        float: average_of_cubes == (1**3 + 2**3 + ... + n**3) / n\n    \"\"\"\n    sum_of_cubes = 0\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        sum_of_cubes += i ** 3\n    return sum_of_cubes / n"}
